Subject: [PATCH 8/9] arm64: dts: r8a7796: Add HSUSB device node
Date: Fri, 18 Aug 2017 10:19:38 +0200
Message-Id: <b9535853777fdf14232e6bc5e166b667b2225b76.1502961153.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
